EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Thanks for contacting Qantas Freight

We know that saying goodbye to a loved one is hard, and we appreciate how difficult this time will be for the family.

With the added stress of being away from home, we’re here to provide all the support needed to arrange this very sensitive trip.

Rest assured, we'll arrange to fly the family's loved one back home and ensure they’re treated with the utmost dignity while in our care and travel with the highest priority throughout the journey.

We’ve created a reference number for you, {!Case.CaseNumber}. Please quote this if you need to contact us urgently. Our number is +1 800 227 0290 (Toll free within USA only), and we’re available during business hours, or you can email us on qffreightusa@qantas.com.au.

We’ll be back in touch shortly. In the meantime, here are the details you’ve provided us with so far:

Type:  {!Case.Type}
Subject:  {!Case.Subject}
Origin:  {!Case.Freight_Origin__c}
Destination:  {!Case.Freight_Destination__c}
